  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-02-29T19:09:58.470Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "While having the \"reset avatar\" is good, it get increasingly annoying when you accidentally hit it, when you go to change your height, etc. And everything reverts and you have to completely redo your whole avatar and get it back to the way you liked (it makes it more annoying if all the toggles on your avatar is in a different language and you spend ages flicking through them all trying to find the right sub menu, and right toggle) but all that would be fully avoidable if there was a \"Are you sure\" option. I'm sure a lot of people will agree when this happens it gets frustrating having to fully redo it. And having this feature would be much more pleasant, Where it's an easy solution, just have \"Are you sure\" with \"Yes\" and \"No\" options that you can click",
